          "y": 0,
          "name": "Sand Garden",
          "fill": {
            "type": "image",
            "enabled": true,
            "url": "./images/generated-1789917278251.png",
            "mode": "fill"
          },
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "ubomN",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Sand Overlay",
          "fill": {
            "type": "gradient",
            "gradientType": "linear",
            "enabled": true,
            "rotation": 90,
            "size": {
              "height": 1
            },
            "colors": [
              {
                "color": "#2A2A2AE8",
                "position": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "#2A2A2ACC",
                "position": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "#2A2A2A55",
                "position": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "F7ltFi",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Cred Content",
          "width": 840,
          "height": 900,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 18,
          "padding": [
            0,
            60,
            0,
            100
          ],
          "justifyContent": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FDAGw",
              "name": "Cred Headline",
              "fill": "$white",
              "content": "Technically Correct\nis Still Wrong.",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Marxg",
              "name": "Cred Intro",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "I'm a BI Architect. My work sits in the space between the systems and the business trying to use them.",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ddyl7",
              "name": "Cred Suspicion",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "That has taught me to be suspicious of technically correct answers to business problems. A dashboard can be fast and still fail the people relying on it. A data platform can be healthy while nobody trusts the number. A system can follow best practices and still be painful to change.",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fsT5X",
              "name": "Cred Machines",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "And increasingly, business logic has to make sense to more than just the person who built it. It has to be understandable to the next person, the next system, and the machines beginning to work alongside them.",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Cc95s",
              "name": "Cred Beyond",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFCC",
              "content": "So I look beyond whether something works.",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qBocP",
              "name": "Cred Core",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFAA",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "I want to know what depends on it, who trusts it, what happens around it, and what the business has quietly learned to compensate for.",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HK53w",
              "name": "Cred Punch",
              "fill": "$white",
              "content": "That's usually where the interesting problem is.",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
